# {{ display_name }} — {{ artifact }}

{{ display_name }} is the Candela Pro equity-research assistant: Gemma 4 12B on Google's QAT int4 weights with a QLoRA adapter trained locally on an Apple M5 Pro. The int4 base stays frozen and unmerged; this repository holds only the {{ artifact }}.

