## Usage

{% if library == "gguf" -%}
```bash
llama-server -m gemma-4-12b-it-qat-q4_0.gguf --lora {{ files[0] }} --jinja
```
{%- else -%}
```python
from mlx_lm import load, generate
model, tokenizer = load("<path to Gemma 4 12B QAT MLX int4>", adapter_path="<this repo>")
```
{%- endif %}

The model is trained to call the Candela market tools (`contracts/tools.json`) for every number and to answer with Snapshot, Trend & Momentum, Fundamentals, Outlook & Risks and Bottom line sections. It gives educational analysis, never personalized advice.

