## Training data

Permissive sources only (see the [data card](https://github.com/UmitVice/candela/blob/main/ml/datacards/{{ dataset_version }}.md)); non-commercial benchmarks are used for evaluation only.

## Limitations

Market numbers must come from tools at inference time; the model is not a source of prices or financials. Not financial advice.
